{"step_index":347,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T00:08:01Z","thinking":"**Verifying company industry classifications**\n\nObserved a discrepancy in the industry classification for `도경테크`. The raw input initially listed a broad category, but NICE BizINFO provides a more specific classification of `선박 구성 부분품 제조업`. Verified other companies' classifications: `청우정공` is categorized as `자동차 엔진용 신품 부품 제조업` and `신영산업` is categorized as `주형 및 금형 제조업`.\n\n\n**Evaluating batch processing feasibility**\n\nThe user's instructions require searching NICE BizINFO for each company, prioritizing `사업자등록번호` and falling back to `회사명` if needed, with a clear instruction to leave the field blank if not found.  A plan has been devised to optimize this search for 200 companies, considering individual query speed in a browser environment. This involves running a batch within the browser. The `browser_evaluate` function in the browser can execute asynchronous logic to return results as JSON.\n\nNow testing the feasibility with a small batch to ensure it can work, using sample companies: 청우정공 (6090653247), 도경테크 (6090657239), and 한웅정공 (609065740).\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"call_mcp_tool","args":{"Arguments":{"function":"async () => {\n  const router = window.useNuxtApp().$router;\n  const list = [\n    { bizno: '6090653247', name: '청우정공', rep: '이상원' },\n    { bizno: '6090657239', name: '도경테크', rep: '하임숙' },\n    { bizno: '6090657409', name: '한웅정공', rep: '한기수' },\n    { bizno: '6090658771', name: '백봉제어기계', rep: '' },\n    { bizno: '6090658790', name: '선도', rep: '윤양호' }\n  ];\n\n  async function search(keyword) {\n    await router.push('/ep/EP0100M001GE.nice?keyword=' + encodeURIComponent(keyword));\n    // wait for render\n    for (let i = 0; i < 30; i++) {\n      const text = document.body.innerText;\n      if (text.includes('검색 결과가 있습니다') || text.includes('검색결과가 없습니다')) break;\n      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 100));\n    }\n    const text = document.body.innerText;\n    if (text.includes('검색결과가 없습니다')) return [];\n    \n    // extract items\n    const items = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.search-item-list .q-item, .search-item-list > div')).filter(el => el.innerText && el.innerText.includes('산업명'));\n    return items.map(el => {\n      const t = el.innerText;\n      const indMatch = t.match(/산업명\\s*([^\\n]+)/);\n      const repMatch = t.match(/대표자명\\s*([^\\n]+)/);\n      const addrMatch = t.match(/기업주소\\s*([^\\n]+)/);\n      const nameMatch = t.match(/^[^\\n]+\\n\\n([^\\n]+)/);\n      return {\n        raw: t,\n        name: nameMatch ? nameMatch[1].trim() : '',\n        industry: indMatch ? indMatch[1].trim() : '',\n        rep: repMatch ? repMatch[1].trim() : '',\n        addr: addrMatch ? addrMatch[1].trim() : ''\n      };\n    });\n  }\n\n  const results = [];\n  for (const item of list) {\n    let res = await search(item.bizno);\n    let match = res[0];\n    let source = 'bizno';\n    \n    if (!match && item.name) {\n      // search by company name\n      res = await search(item.name);\n      source = 'name';\n      if (res.length === 1) {\n        match = res[0];\n      } else if (res.length > 1) {\n        // match by rep or region\n        match = res.find(r => (item.rep && r.rep.includes(item.rep)) || r.addr.includes('경남') || r.addr.includes('창원') || r.addr.includes('김해')) || res[0];\n      }\n    }\n\n    results.push({\n      bizno: item.bizno,\n      name: item.name,\n      found: !!match,\n      industry: match ? match.industry : '',\n      matchedRep: match ? match.rep : '',\n      matchedAddr: match ? match.addr : '',\n      source\n    });\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 100));\n  }\n\n  return results;\n}"},"ServerName":"playwright","ToolName":"browser_evaluate","toolAction":"Testing batch search on nicebizinfo","toolSummary":"Test batch search"}}]}
